  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nIn <i>Rage of Towers</i>, tower defense meets real-time action. You’ll defend your base from massive waves of enemies using classic tower defense strategy – but this time, you’re not just watching from above. Step into the battlefield and take control.<p></p>\n<p>In most tower defense games, you build and watch. In <i>Rage of Towers</i>, the battlefield is <b>dynamic and reactive</b> – towers aren’t just static weapons, and enemies won’t wait patiently in line. You’ll need to adapt in real time, taking control of special towers and mobile units, redirecting fire, and executing clutch defenses to survive.</p>\n<p>If you love the planning and payoff of tower defense, but crave <b>more control, more action, and more depth</b>, <i>Rage of Towers</i> is for you. It rewards quick thinking, strategic foresight, and clutch decision-making – all in one tightly designed package.</p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Hybrid of tower defense and real-time tactical control.\n</li><li>Direct tower/unit micromanagement.\n</li><li>Dozens of towers and upgrades.\n</li><li>Unique enemy waves.\n</li><li>Multiple maps and enemy types.\n</li><li>Long Campaign, Endless.\n</li><li>Realistic visuals and dynamic battlefields.\n</li></ul>\n",
